File notes
==========

Reference_Implementation contains portable C implementations for the three
OAEP-NTRU parameter sets.

Optimized_Implementation contains optimized implementations for the same three
parameter sets. These directories include AVX2 source files and handwritten
assembly source files under asm/.

Additional_Implementation contains modified versions of the reference
implementations for the same three parameter sets. These variants keep the
same implementation structure but obtain random bytes from an operating-system
randomness source instead of using the deterministic submission DRNG. 


KAT_KEM.c                  Source file for generating KEM known-answer tests.
KEM_AlgorithmInstance.c    Source file implementing the KEM API functions.
KEM_AlgorithmInstance.h    Header defining the KEM interface and algorithm
                           instance macros.
Makefile                   Build rules for the implementation directory.
README.txt                 Submission framework instructions.
auxfunc.c                  Source file of auxiliary functions.
auxfunc.h                  Header file of auxiliary functions.
drng.c                     Randomness provider used by the KEM and KAT code.
                           In the reference and optimized implementations this
                           is the deterministic submission DRNG; in the
                           additional implementations it is backed by an
                           operating-system randomness source.
drng.h                     Header file for the randomness provider interface.
params.h                   Parameter settings for the selected OAEP-NTRU
                           instance.
poly.c                     Polynomial arithmetic implementation.
poly.h                     Polynomial type definitions and declarations.
ntt.c                      C implementation or wrapper for NTT operations.
ntt.h                      Header for NTT declarations and constants.
reduce.h                   Modular reduction helpers.
symmetric.c                Hash and XOF wrapper implementation.
symmetric.h                Hash and XOF wrapper declarations.
avx2.c                     AVX2 optimized polynomial and arithmetic routines.
avx2.h                     Header for AVX2 optimized routines.
ntt_asm_consts.c           Constants used by handwritten NTT assembly.
asm/*.s                    Handwritten assembly routines used by optimized
                           implementations.

